1
00:00:49,060 --> 00:00:53,030
[The Old Story of Yu Hong]

2
00:00:53,600 --> 00:00:55,910
[Episode 33]

3
00:01:01,380 --> 00:01:03,340
Sometimes, to survive,

4
00:01:06,930 --> 00:01:08,730
you have to let someone else die.

5
00:01:28,730 --> 00:01:33,530
[Long Ago]

6
00:01:28,730 --> 00:01:29,700
Man,

7
00:01:30,400 --> 00:01:31,060
you haven't

8
00:01:31,680 --> 00:01:32,930
had enough

9
00:01:34,539 --> 00:01:35,920
to drink.

10
00:01:36,259 --> 00:01:37,460
Come on, I'll take you

11
00:01:37,780 --> 00:01:42,180
somewhere to r-relax.

12
00:01:51,150 --> 00:01:52,210
That little tart's

13
00:01:52,870 --> 00:01:55,920
doing good business.

14
00:01:59,590 --> 00:02:00,790
Let's get in line.

15
00:02:10,530 --> 00:02:11,860
That, no...

16
00:02:13,080 --> 00:02:14,680
Y-You're drunk, aren't you?

17
00:02:15,090 --> 00:02:17,180
W-why...

18
00:02:17,910 --> 00:02:18,910
Why do I need help?

19
00:02:44,620 --> 00:02:47,090
You know what brand this watch is?

20
00:02:50,560 --> 00:02:51,240
What brand?

21
00:02:51,680 --> 00:02:52,930
Rolex.

22
00:02:54,210 --> 00:02:55,370
I'm not bragging,

23
00:02:56,340 --> 00:02:58,070
but just look around Tiecheng.

24
00:02:58,590 --> 00:03:00,350
C-Count them if you want.

25
00:03:00,370 --> 00:03:02,300
There are no more than three people

26
00:03:03,910 --> 00:03:05,970
who wear this brand.

27
00:03:11,280 --> 00:03:12,090
Bro,

28
00:03:14,690 --> 00:03:15,860
if I follow you,

29
00:03:17,030 --> 00:03:18,490
can I get a watch like this?

30
00:03:24,130 --> 00:03:25,210
You bet.

31
00:03:34,590 --> 00:03:35,210
Bro,

32
00:03:37,250 --> 00:03:39,450
that apartment building on Siying Road

33
00:03:39,590 --> 00:03:41,650
gets a lot of people coming and going.

34
00:03:42,079 --> 00:03:44,010
Is it safe to stash the goods there?

35
00:03:49,240 --> 00:03:50,780
Once you enter the complex,

36
00:03:53,520 --> 00:03:54,850
it's the first building

37
00:03:55,320 --> 00:03:56,630
on the left,

38
00:03:58,630 --> 00:03:59,579
third floor.

39
00:04:00,650 --> 00:04:02,130
An old lady

40
00:04:03,080 --> 00:04:05,480
died in there and lay there
for half a month.

41
00:04:06,590 --> 00:04:09,450
By the time they dragged her out,
she already stank.

42
00:04:10,080 --> 00:04:11,690
Leave the goods in there.

43
00:04:12,730 --> 00:04:14,330
Nobody would dare take them.

44
00:04:17,029 --> 00:04:18,360
Who was that old lady?

45
00:04:24,190 --> 00:04:25,130
My grandma.

46
00:04:54,500 --> 00:04:56,240
Where's my cigarette?

47
00:07:56,720 --> 00:07:59,060
So was that shipment really worth a lot?

48
00:08:04,570 --> 00:08:06,570
I didn't touch that shipment at all.

49
00:08:10,390 --> 00:08:12,500
Then why did you kill Zhao Changyou?

50
00:08:23,750 --> 00:08:25,660
What if I told you
the Yellow Immortal came to me in a dream

51
00:08:25,660 --> 00:08:26,920
and told me to kill him?

52
00:08:30,060 --> 00:08:31,260
Would you believe me?

53
00:08:46,250 --> 00:08:47,770
Did you kill Dong?

54
00:08:51,240 --> 00:08:53,040
I saw you two get into the same car

55
00:08:53,510 --> 00:08:55,770
when I came back from Guangzhou that day.

56
00:08:56,890 --> 00:08:58,490
He disappeared the next day.

57
00:09:39,670 --> 00:09:41,330
Was he trying to hurt you, too?

58
00:09:56,780 --> 00:09:58,380
Could he really hurt me?

59
00:10:13,140 --> 00:10:13,990
Yang,

60
00:10:17,130 --> 00:10:18,990
the moment you came over just now,

61
00:10:19,170 --> 00:10:21,570
I could tell you had something
on your mind.

62
00:10:22,500 --> 00:10:24,300
They were all trying to hurt you.

63
00:10:24,580 --> 00:10:26,130
Don't do anything stupid.

64
00:10:31,140 --> 00:10:32,620
Are you planning to run?

65
00:10:36,200 --> 00:10:37,700
They're the bad guys.

66
00:10:37,740 --> 00:10:39,340
They were trying to hurt you.

67
00:10:40,240 --> 00:10:42,080
It was self-defense.

68
00:10:43,790 --> 00:10:44,910
Turn yourself in.

69
00:10:44,910 --> 00:10:46,110
I'll testify for you.

70
00:10:46,220 --> 00:10:48,290
The police will believe me.

71
00:11:23,220 --> 00:11:24,080
Your daughter?

72
00:11:26,480 --> 00:11:27,290
Cute, huh?

73
00:11:31,840 --> 00:11:33,170
She looks just like you.

74
00:11:37,720 --> 00:11:38,480
So I guess

75
00:11:40,870 --> 00:11:42,730
that makes me her paternal uncle.

76
00:11:45,260 --> 00:11:46,860
If only she were my sister's.

77
00:11:47,980 --> 00:11:49,710
Then I'd be her maternal uncle.

78
00:11:57,030 --> 00:11:58,440
That's why you can't run, Yang.

79
00:11:58,440 --> 00:11:59,720
If you run,

80
00:12:01,620 --> 00:12:03,350
it'll only confirm your guilt.

81
00:12:09,270 --> 00:12:09,980
Man,

82
00:12:12,170 --> 00:12:13,080
do me a favor.

83
00:12:13,410 --> 00:12:14,220
Name it.

84
00:12:20,100 --> 00:12:22,030
You don't have to ask me for favors.

85
00:12:37,220 --> 00:12:38,240
I have a family

86
00:12:39,510 --> 00:12:40,500
and kids,

87
00:12:43,360 --> 00:12:44,740
but you have nothing.

88
00:13:40,870 --> 00:13:41,570
Yang,

89
00:13:41,890 --> 00:13:42,890
you're a good man,

90
00:13:43,010 --> 00:13:44,470
so you'll live a long life.

91
00:13:45,050 --> 00:13:46,230
They're bad people,

92
00:13:46,360 --> 00:13:48,160
so their lives will be cut short.

93
00:13:48,960 --> 00:13:50,960
This is my buddy.
The ride-or-die kind.

94
00:13:50,960 --> 00:13:52,390
We've been friends
since we were in diapers.

95
00:13:52,390 --> 00:13:53,710
And he's loyal as hell.

96
00:13:53,780 --> 00:13:55,380
I've always looked up to him.

97
00:13:55,980 --> 00:13:57,320
That's what a brother is.

98
00:13:57,320 --> 00:13:59,290
When you're stuck in a swamp,

99
00:13:59,290 --> 00:14:01,350
he'll reach in and pull you right out.

100
00:14:07,390 --> 00:14:08,900
Even if you were a ghost,

101
00:14:09,290 --> 00:14:10,770
you'd still be my brother.

102
00:14:11,100 --> 00:14:13,550
I'd warm that heart of yours
right back up.

103
00:14:14,670 --> 00:14:15,960
You can still eat,

104
00:14:15,960 --> 00:14:18,420
get married, and have kids
like anyone else.

105
00:14:45,320 --> 00:14:54,100
[Wanted Notice]

106
00:14:54,180 --> 00:14:57,820
[Golden Imperial Dance Hall]

107
00:15:11,670 --> 00:15:14,240
[Fur from a Siying Road Apartment]

108
00:15:11,760 --> 00:15:14,480
The wildlife and wild plant products
they were trading

109
00:15:14,480 --> 00:15:16,310
were certainly worth
more than a million yuan.

110
00:15:16,310 --> 00:15:17,980
The evidence we found
at the crime scene on Siying Road

111
00:15:17,980 --> 00:15:19,580
ties together all the leads

112
00:15:19,580 --> 00:15:20,580
we've uncovered.

113
00:15:20,620 --> 00:15:23,290
Lin Yunsong and the other two
supplied Zhao Changyou,

114
00:15:23,290 --> 00:15:25,030
and the goods passed
through Liang Zhendong's hands

115
00:15:25,030 --> 00:15:26,270
before being sold in the south.

116
00:15:26,270 --> 00:15:28,400
[Found at the scene:
cigarette butt left of the freezer]

117
00:15:26,360 --> 00:15:27,410
After the mountain fire,

118
00:15:27,410 --> 00:15:29,530
Liang Zhendong feared the whole thing
would be exposed,

119
00:15:28,880 --> 00:15:33,110
[Fur from an Apartment Building
on Siying Road]

120
00:15:29,530 --> 00:15:30,980
so he killed Zhao Changyou.

121
00:15:30,980 --> 00:15:32,670
The killer was

122
00:15:32,670 --> 00:15:34,980
likely Hao Peng, also known as San Yan'er.

123
00:15:34,980 --> 00:15:36,030
Hao Peng

124
00:15:36,290 --> 00:15:37,650
came from a struggling family

125
00:15:37,650 --> 00:15:39,480
and wanted Liang Zhendong dead.

126
00:15:39,480 --> 00:15:41,460
In the end, he kept the entire shipment
for himself.

127
00:15:41,460 --> 00:15:43,770
As for Li Dewu,

128
00:15:43,770 --> 00:15:45,360
who was found dead in the square
with one hand missing,

129
00:15:45,360 --> 00:15:46,690
that's a separate case.

130
00:15:48,100 --> 00:15:49,440
His driver is still on the run.

131
00:15:49,440 --> 00:15:50,340
We can only get to the truth

132
00:15:50,340 --> 00:15:51,650
if we catch him.

133
00:15:52,060 --> 00:15:54,060
[Photo Paper]

134
00:15:52,550 --> 00:15:53,820
So far,

135
00:15:53,820 --> 00:15:55,510
the evidence does line up.

136
00:15:54,060 --> 00:15:57,420
[Button Found in the Victim's Hand
in the Freezer]

137
00:15:56,900 --> 00:15:59,300
But I still feel like there's something...

138
00:16:08,020 --> 00:16:08,640
Juan,

139
00:16:10,100 --> 00:16:12,180
the chief asked you to assist us
with the investigation.

140
00:16:12,180 --> 00:16:13,910
Why don't you give us your take?

141
00:16:46,150 --> 00:16:48,680
That button of yours
is already coming loose.

142
00:16:48,890 --> 00:16:49,700
Hurry and take it off.

143
00:16:49,700 --> 00:16:50,500
I'll stitch it for you real quick.

144
00:16:50,500 --> 00:16:51,370
If it falls off,

145
00:16:51,370 --> 00:16:52,320
I'll have to replace the whole row

146
00:16:52,320 --> 00:16:53,100
since it'll be hard
to find a matching button.

147
00:16:53,100 --> 00:16:53,720
Forget it.

148
00:16:54,490 --> 00:16:56,820
Hao Jie is waiting for me.
Maybe next time.

149
00:16:58,290 --> 00:17:00,220
That button would be hard to match.

150
00:17:38,090 --> 00:17:38,590
Hey,

151
00:17:41,510 --> 00:17:42,110
what's up?

152
00:17:46,790 --> 00:17:47,920
It's pretty late...

153
00:17:49,530 --> 00:17:50,460
All right, then.

154
00:17:52,530 --> 00:17:53,200
Okay, okay.

155
00:17:58,090 --> 00:18:00,290
My sister wants me to go home for dinner.

156
00:18:01,790 --> 00:18:02,530
What's up?

157
00:18:02,790 --> 00:18:03,650
She didn't say.

158
00:18:04,810 --> 00:18:06,340
She didn't sound too happy.

159
00:18:10,450 --> 00:18:11,920
I'm guessing my ex-brother-in-law

160
00:18:11,920 --> 00:18:13,520
wants to take Qianqian back.

161
00:18:14,330 --> 00:18:18,110
My sister's been with Qianqian so long,
she must see Qianqian as her own.

162
00:18:18,110 --> 00:18:19,170
I'll go over there.

163
00:18:19,460 --> 00:18:20,440
Be back soon.

164
00:18:20,440 --> 00:18:21,090
Okay.

165
00:18:35,500 --> 00:18:37,350
[Junlan Grand Hotel] [Friendly Reminder]

166
00:18:37,720 --> 00:18:46,780
[Junlan Grand Hotel] [Friendly Reminder]

167
00:18:53,300 --> 00:19:03,000
[Junlan Grand Hotel] [Friendly Reminder]
